OL,3,GNEWSATrader could face bankruptcy after
OL,4,Amarket stint
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Derby Market Hall trader said
OL,7,Fhe had to leave the flat he was renting
OL,8,Fand thought about filing for bankruptcy
OL,9,Fafter a "nightmare" period at the
OL,10,Fcentre.
OL,12,FAntonias Grimpokostas ran Tony's Greek
OL,13,FStreet Food, but after he said footfall
OL,14,Fin the market became virtually
OL,15,Fnon-existent, he closed the unit in
OL,16,FNovember and is now working two jobs to
OL,17,Fmake a living.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
