OL,3,GNEWSATrader could face bankruptcy after
OL,4,Amarket stint
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I lost my house, no payments, no
OL,7,Fmoney, I left without a job. I have
OL,8,Fpayments and creditors and I'm already
OL,9,Fbehind on that - I'm really facing
OL,10,Fbankruptcy," he said.
OL,12,FDerby City Council said the Market Hall
OL,13,Fhad established itself as a destination
OL,14,Fand it was focused on delivering on its
OL,15,Ffull potential going forward.
